# Start Exploration: repeat SWEEP and freshly planned EXECUTE_PATH indefinitely.
# Confirmed smoke/fire enters Verify, then resumes Exploration within this goal.
# Set true to skip the initial TAKEOFF; requires airborne, armed AUTO.LOITER.
# The default false runs TAKEOFF once and requires a disarmed vehicle.
# Cancellation ends the goal; battery alerts, Abort/Return and errors abort it.
# Recovery requests LOITER. A terminal goal requires a new goal to resume.
bool skip_takeoff
---
bool success
string message
---
# Current Exploration/Verify child state or mission lifecycle event.
string state
string message
